---
layout: base.njk
title: Journal
permalink: /
---

<div class="s6-measure">
  {% set heading = "Journal" %}
  {% set lede = "For riders who are past the honeymoon phase. Not here for gear lists or destination guides, here to think through what actually happens out there, and why." %}
  {% include "page-header.njk" %}

  {% set recentPosts = collections.posts | reverse | limit(10) %}
  {% if recentPosts and recentPosts.length > 0 %}
  <ul class="s6-journal">
    {% for post in recentPosts %}{% include "entry-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="s6-empty body">Nothing filed yet. Check back.</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
